            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QToolButton" name="bounds_info_button">
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lower and upper limits allowed for each fitted parameter (normalized emittance ε, Twiss β and α) during the emittance/Twiss fit, set separately for the horizontal and vertical planes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;They restrict the optimizer's search space to physically reasonable solutions and help the fit converge reliably. Pre-filled from the machine defaults, but editable per measurement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Additionally, the tool is able to fit misaligned quadrupoles, roll, and current readback mismatch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the method selected doesn't require a scan, this is ignored.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
              <property name="styleSheet">
               <string notr="true">QToolButton#bounds_info_button {
    border: 1px solid #888;
    border-radius: 11px;
    min-width: 22px;
    max-width: 22px;
    min-height: 22px;
    max-height: 22px;
    padding: 0px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
QToolButton#bounds_info_button:hover {
    background-color: #e6e6e6;
}</string>
              </property>
              <property name="text">
